@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Sessão do criador
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

> {% client.global.set("ownerToken", response.body.token); %}

### Criar partida
POST {{baseUrl}}/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{}

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.game.id); client.global.set("invite", response.body.invitation); %}

### Sessão do convidado
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

> {% client.global.set("guestToken", response.body.token); %}

### Ocupar pretas com convite (primeiro aceite)
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}/join
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

{"invitation": "{{invite}}"}

### Consultar partida
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Primeiro lance — repetir o mesmo bloco testa idempotência
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "from": { "row": 5, "column": 0 },
  "landings": [{ "row": 4, "column": 1 }],
  "expectedVersion": 0,
  "clientMoveId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333"
}
